/-!
# Audit: actual finite irreducible path and kernel pole amplitudes

All 237 public definitions and theorems of the ten proof modules are
audited below. Actual finite path integrals sum to the true resolvent, whose
Perron pole and residue are proved. Finite kernel products and true product
measure integration give the exact cubic leading amplitude; the explicit
forbidden correction and noncubic shape amplitudes lose one singular factor.

Negative unit eigenvalues remain allowed. No B2/regular-critical adapter or
unproved singularity/transfer premise is introduced. This batch does not yet
identify the full connected-graph EGF on a global Delta product, nor prove
its uniform coefficient transfer or the complete finite Perron--Wright theorem.
-/

